1. Customer Side Restaurant Hub & Smart FiltersRestaurant Marketplace: Jab customer apne Hub me "Restaurant & Food" par click karega, toh ek shandar food page open hoga jahan area ke saare live restaurants dikhenge.Advanced Filters: Us page par upar hi Veg, Non-Veg, Egg filter, Nearby location sorting, aur dish/category search ka option hoga, bilkul ek professional food delivery app ki tarah.Direct Ordering: Customer apni pasand ki dish select karke cart me daalega aur online ya cash order place kar dega, jo seedha vendor ke live dashboard aur Kitchen Display (KDS) par pahunch jayega.2. QR Code & Table Ordering System (Jo aapne abhi banaya hai)Jo screen aapne dikhayi hai (Smart Catalogs), wahan vendor har table (jaise Table 1, Table 2 ya Takeaway) ke liye alag QR code generate karta hai.   Jab koi customer restaurant me baith kar us QR ko scan karta hai, toh use wahi table ka menu khula hua milta hai. Customer wahi se order kar deta hai, aur vendor ko pata chal jata hai ki kis table se order aaya hai.   Agar customer ghar baitha hai ya restaurant ke bahar hai, toh wo seedha website ke Customer Hub se restaurant khoj kar order kar sakta hai.3. Universal Multi-Business Delivery System (Sabhi Business ke liye Ek hi Delivery Hub)Aapka yeh sochna ki chahe order restaurant ka ho, grocery ka ho, ya shopping store ka ho, delivery ek hi delivery boy kare — yeh ekdum perfect multi-vendor logistics model hai! Iske liye system me yeh structure rahega:Delivery Partner Role: Jaise Customer aur Vendor ka login hota hai, waise hi platform par ek Delivery Partner / Rider ka role hoga.Unified Delivery Hub: Har registered delivery boy ke paas apna ek "Delivery Hub" hoga.Order Dispatching: Jab bhi koi bhi vendor (chahe wo restaurant ho ya grocery/shopping store) apna order "Ready" karega, wo use platform par active delivery boy ko assign kar dega.Live Delivery Tracking: Delivery boy ke mobile/hub par notification aa jayegi ki kahan se item pick karna hai aur customer ko kahan deliver karna hai. Wo sabhi business ke orders ko ek hi app se manage karke deliver kar sakega.Is tarah se yeh poora ecosystem (Vendor Catalog ➔ QR / Hub Ordering ➔ Universal Delivery Hub) aapas me jud jayega aur aapka platform ek complete local super-app ban jayega.